  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">4.1 Adaptive Reserve</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme management support function enhances the Somalia Bilateral Programme&#x2019;s (SBP) quality and responsiveness through monitoring and evaluation, technical reviews and studies, structured learning activities, and targeted support contracts. It also includes an Adaptive Reserve that can finance cost-extensions or new engagements within the SBP&#x2019;s existing objectives.

The Somalia Bilateral Programme contributes to stability, inclusive governance, and sustainable development by addressing key drivers of fragility and supporting climate adaptation, green growth, rights-based state-building, and community resilience</narrative>
  </description>
